WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.822
Before publishing a reusable database object, review more than whether the query runs.

00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:08.462
Ask what one row represents.

00:00:08.462 --> 00:00:11.197
Ask which columns are exposed.

00:00:11.197 --> 00:00:14.277
Ask how current the data needs to be.

00:00:14.277 --> 00:00:18.188
Check which source tables and views the object depends on.

00:00:18.673 --> 00:00:25.245
Also ask who owns the business definition and who is responsible for maintaining the object.

00:00:25.245 --> 00:00:30.688
These questions turn a saved query into a reliable analytical interface.
